 * keymaps; this plate shows a few real rows. Chords and descriptions are
 * limited to rows verified in the product repository (see the plan's claims
 * ledger, C-01 to C-07 and C-27). HTML/CSS; language-keyed i18n (en fallback);
 * role="img"; dark mode; zero JS. Spec: docs/DIAGRAM_COMPONENTS.md.
 */
